          "\u00b7",
          "Compensation and Benefits. Compensation and benefits increased 6.6% year-over-year to $409,353 in fiscal 2025 from $384,119 in fiscal 2024. Management assumed personnel costs would remain relatively s"
        ],
        [
          "",
          "\u00b7",
          "General and Administrative Expenses. General and administrative expenses remained effectively flat year-over-year at approximately $701,293 in fiscal 2025 compared to $701,189 in fiscal 2024. The proj"
        ],
        [
          "",
          "\u00b7",
          "Operating Margin Recovery. The Company reported income before income taxes of $112,511 in fiscal 2024 and a loss before income taxes of $(19,699) in fiscal 2025, primarily reflecting lower commission "
        ],
