          "\u00b7",
          "Liquidity and Cash Flow: The Company generated net cash from operations of\u00a0$84,572\u00a0in fiscal 2025 compared to\u00a0$12,965\u00a0in fiscal 2024, reflecting significant working capital improvements. As of June 30"
        ],
        [
          "",
          "\u00b7",
          "Market Demand and Demographics . The Company\u2019s revenue is sensitive to (a) international student and immigrant population trends; (b) visa and immigration policy changes; and (c) college and universit"
        ],
        [
          "",
          "\u00b7",
          "Carrier Commission Structures . The Company\u2019s revenue depends on (a) commission rates negotiated with insurance carriers; (b) renewal rates; and (c) product mix shifts between health and P&C lines."
        ],
        [
          "",
          "\u00b7",
          "Marketing Efficiency and Conversion . The Company\u2019s performance is influenced by digital marketing efficiency and conversion rates. The projections assumed continued use of proprietary database tools "
        ],
        [
          "",
          "\u00b7",
          "Retention and Renewal Rates . Recurring commission streams depend on renewal activity."
        ],
        [
          "",
          "\u00b7",
          "Regulatory Environment . Changes in immigration policy, insurance regulations, or data privacy laws could materially affect growth assumptions"
        ],
        [
          "",
          "\u00b7",
          "Competitive Landscape. The assumptions consider the Company\u2019s ability to effectively compete in a rapidly evolving market. This involves staying ahead of competitors through unique value propositions,"
